  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Prest. CT Red Ipea, IBGE, FGV y Otros</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TC Loan Ipea Network, IBGE, FGV, and Other</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS REIMBURSABLE TECHNICAL COOPERATION WILL SUPPORT AND STRENGTHEN VARIOUS PUBLIC AND QUASI-PUBLIC ORGANIZATIONS, INCLUDING IPEA (TO ESTABLISH AN INFORMATION NETWORK WITH FEDERAL ENTITIES), IBGE (TO IMPROVE AND STANDARDIZE ECONOMIC AND FINANCIAL INFORMATION AND STATISTICS), THE GETULIO VARGAS FOUNDATION (SUPPORT FOR THE &quot;CONJUNTURA ECONOMICA&quot;), INAE (SUPPORT FOR THE NATIONAL FORUMS ON SOCIAL TOPICS), AND OTHER ENTITIES INVOLVED IN SOCIOECONOMIC STUDIES AND INFORMATION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
